    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Children",
      "notes": "Keep out of reach of children."
    },
    {
      "type": "Storage",
      "notes": "Store in a cool, dry place."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "In a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 112 healthy volunteers, subjects taking the GNC vitamin and mineral blends for six weeks experienced significant improvements in serum levels of certain key nutrients compared to a placebo and leading multivitamin formula based upon multivariate statistical analyses of a group of B vitamins (thiamin, niacin, riboflavin, pantothenic acid, biotin, folic acid and vitamins B-6 and B-12) and key antioxidants and carotenoids (a group of beta-carotene, alpha-tocopherol, selenium, lutein and lycopene). Statistical improvements in SF-36 Vitality and Mental Health scores were also observed compared to placebo."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Physician endorsed \nThis product is endorsed by the GNC Medical Advisory Board. This team of esteemed physicians utilizes their extensive medical knowledge and experience to aid in the creation of GNC premium products, helping you to achieve optimal health through comprehensive nutritional support so you can live your best life!"
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Statement of Identity",
      "notes": "Dietary Supplement"
    },
    {
      "type": "Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)",
      "notes": "Vitapak program with clinically studied multivitamin"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "- Antioxidants\n- Energy & metabolism\n- Heart health\n- Sexual health"
    },
    {
      "type": "Seals/Symbols",
      "notes": "Physician endorsed"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "New\nEnergy"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Achieve your daily nutritional goals with customized ingredients plus multivitamins that have more antioxidant power than ever, contain 30 clinically studied ingredients - and are smaller and easier to swallow."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Men’s health \nContains a clinically studied men’s multivitamin formula shown to work better than a basic multivitamin. \nAntioxidants\nPacked with antioxidants to help fight free radicals that can be produced during intense exercise."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Heart health\nHas EPA, which is important for cardiovascular and circulatory health and promotes healthy cholesterol and triglyceride levels."
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Disclaimer Statement",
      "notes": "These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."
